WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Find a surah by name or number, then select it.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Choose the first and last ayahs. Listen to the passage before reciting.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Select a word to open its pronunciation guide and listen to the expert.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Allow microphone access, record, then stop. You can also upload audio. After analysis, select a highlighted word to review it.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Choose your language. Turn transliteration and advanced rules on or off.

